:::text id=s7_title x=80 y=45 w=929 h=70 preset=title align=left color=#F8FAFC fontSize=44
Rules of Engagement — Pet Peeves & Golden Rules
:::

:::shape id=s7_col1_bg x=80 y=140 w=445 h=510 kind=rect fill=#1E293B borderRadius=8
:::

:::text id=s7_col1_txt x=100 y=160 w=405 h=470 preset=body align=left color=#F8FAFC
:::icon[name="x-circle" color="#EF4444"]:::
**Pet Peeves (What to Avoid)**

• **Unscheduled communication** for non-urgent matters without warning.

• **Refusal of ideas** or proposals without clear reasons or context.
:::

:::shape id=s7_col2_bg x=564 y=140 w=445 h=510 kind=rect fill=#1E293B borderRadius=8
:::

:::text id=s7_col2_txt x=584 y=160 w=405 h=470 preset=body align=left color=#F8FAFC
:::icon[name="check-circle" color="#10B981"]:::
**Golden Rules (Best Practices)**

• **Notify me beforehand** for synchronous check-ins or live meetings.

• **Give reasons** for idea/proposal refusal, and optionally suggest alternatives.
:::
